{"id":"353b45b92236cdbb","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-halting-problem.md","title":"Halting Problem","display":"df-halting-problem — Halting Problem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-halting-problem","aliases":["88-df-halting-problem"],"display":"df-halting-problem — Halting Problem","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-tm-halts]]","[[88-df-encoding]]","[[88-df-tm-description-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-halting-problem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-halting-problem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-halting-problem — Halting Problem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c5514506c707c9ae\" href=\"?note=c5514506c707c9ae\" title=\"88-df-tm-description-numbering\">88-df-tm-description-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 为已固定的机器族，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathrm{FullTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span>；定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c5514506c707c9ae\" href=\"?note=c5514506c707c9ae\" title=\"88-df-tm-description-numbering\">88-df-tm-description-numbering</a>。输入字母表明确为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\">\\(\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\\)</span> (halting predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (effective pairing/tuple code, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> (binary input encoding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> (binary halting set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}halting\\text{-}problem} \\vdash\nH\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(e,x):\ne,x\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}halting\\text{-}problem} \\vdash\nH\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(e,x):\ne,x\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M_e)\">\\((M_e)\\)</span> 取为输入字母表已规范化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 的有效机器编号；集合元素\n是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}(e,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}(e,x)\\)</span>给出的自然数码，机器实际接收有限二进制词。</li>\n<li>不可判定性与可枚举性是关于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>的后续定理，不属于本定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-halts","status":"resolved","id":"a93cc0702f1280f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-halts]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-description-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"c5514506c707c9ae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-description-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-description-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"c5514506c707c9ae","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ 为已固定的机器族，满足 $\\mathrm{FullTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M)$；定义见 [[88-df-tm-description-numbering]]。输入字母表明确为 $\\{0,1\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-halts","status":"resolved","id":"a93cc0702f1280f5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))$ (halting predicate, see [[88-df-tm-halts]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$ (effective pairing/tuple code, see [[88-df-encoding]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$ (binary input encoding, see [[88-df-encoding]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FullTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}halting\\text{-}problem} \\vdash\nH\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(e,x):\ne,x\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"(M_e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}(e,x)","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false}],"bytes":1331,"backlinks":[{"id":"f95558608cb43df9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$H$ (binary halting set, see [[88-df-halting-problem]])"},{"id":"7fc86c3938d33b41","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$H\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ (binary halting set, see [[88-df-halting-problem]])"},{"id":"7afb5336de3919a0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$H\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ (binary halting set, see [[88-df-halting-problem]])"},{"id":"9902caa90f78b454","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$H\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ (binary halting set, see [[88-df-halting-problem]])"},{"id":"c5ec4a3797008b26","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正